2	// Kernel-sourced tuple derivation for the harvester tools. No value table is
3	// hand-written here: a glyph word is imscribed through the kernel's own
4	// structural witness (program_from_glyphs → self_imscribe → from_snapshot), and
5	// per-axis value lists come from catalog::ordinal_table, the single source of
6	// truth. Arbitrary bytes (a hex key, a text fragment) become an ORDERED IMASM
7	// program via the canonical mark→glyph→token route and are imscribed the same
