4666	// dynamics primitives, same anchors: <<=𐑹 ⋈<=𐑐 ⊤<=𐑧 ⊥<=𐑫 ⊡<=𐑭.
4667	// See manuscripts/clay_cross_dialect_closure.md for the derivation. Uses
