/// All three gates of a dialect at index `idx`. Dialects 0-11 dispatch to
/// dialect.rs's dialect_gates_pass instead of reading `u` directly —
/// all_dialects()[9..=11] hold a second, unrelated hand-crafted dialect
/// family (dialect_expansion.rs's own "HAND-CRAFTED EXPANSION (8-28)")
