102	/// The 12 dialects (of 88) whose gate-pass sequence reached the exact true
103	/// multiplicative order of a mod n, checked via `dialect-probe` on four cases
104	/// (n=143,a=3,r=15; n=91,a=2,r=12; n=19,a=8,r=6; n=61,a=21,r=12), the last two
105	/// built specifically so the native parity grade's own period (2 and 4) came
106	/// in short of the true order — the exact gap this module's reading route
107	/// once named as open. See the module doc comment above.
108	pub const DIALECT_REGISTER: [u8; 12] = [9, 25, 32, 35, 40, 43, 52, 54, 66, 72, 76, 83];
